# B-INF-12: every text file checks out with LF on every OS. On a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true the working tree used to get CRLF, and the guard tests that read a
# component's source and split it on "\n" failed locally while CI passed — known-false
# failures that hid real ones. Guard: app/scripts/lineEndings.test.ts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
*.jar binary
